{"title":"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Liliana owes Abigail <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/2/8620fd780fe6d36b9533cf660e311f0bc145e79a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />. If she gives Abigail <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7624dcadc484bda9f22dbd28147054ace34802b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, how much does she still owe?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/8/82831f7b0a7ad1c28d040c6bf6ac55cbc5eeb063.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$6 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$4 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$11 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$7 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Liliana still owes Abigail <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b07367ba832c5edc9091c63ae514acb8984d6952.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$11 - \\$4 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } \\$7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"159\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px s